  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Bo Qing’s sword light clears layers of illusion, Heavenly Pool, the location of Heavenly Lotus Sect, remains far beyond the horizon.",
      "chapters": [
        963
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bo_qing",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page uses the Central Continent region field because chapter 963 ties Heavenly Pool to Heavenly Lotus Sect there. Chapter 963 does not seat it as a fixed five-region map pin.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From outside it looks like a small pool among the world’s smallest Immortal Gu Houses, filled with green lotuses some open and some closed, and every lotus holds a blessed land or grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1000
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the location of Heavenly Lotus Sect, after rank eight fighting turns an enormous area into desolate land, three Immortal Gu Houses hover: Canary Pavilion, Yue Yang Palace, and the central rank eight Heavenly Pool. It is called the base of Heavenly Lotus Sect, created by Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable, and its greatest use is to store immortal apertures.",
      "chapters": [
        1000
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-gu-house",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_canary_pavilion",
        "house_yue_yang_palace",
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Song Zi Xing says that without taking down Heavenly Pool, losses to Heavenly Lotus Sect cannot count as truly harming them. Yu Mu Chun adds that Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable was most specialized in healing and recovery among the ten venerables, and that Heavenly Pool inherits that style so severely that unless it is broken apart in one attack it can recover any severe losses in a short time. Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord’s furious voice later comes from within Heavenly Pool as the three Immortal Gu Houses chase Shadow Sect’s retreating group.",
      "chapters": [
        1000
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-gu-house",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_zi_xing",
        "char_yu_mu_chun",
        "char_heaven_overseeing_tower_lord",
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tai Bai Yun Sheng names three great pools famous in the history of the five regions: Heavenly Pool, Regret Pool, and Wine Pool.",
      "chapters": [
        1103
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-great-pools",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "house_regret_pool",
        "loc_wine_pool"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shi Zheng Yi asks whether Heavenly Lotus Sect has a fourth Immortal Gu House beyond Canary Pavilion, Yue Yang Palace, and Heavenly Pool. Mu Ling Lan answers that Heavenly Lotus Sect recently created a fourth Immortal Gu House in secret.",
      "chapters": [
        1233
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "house-count",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shi_zheng_yi",
        "char_mu_ling_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later narration again calls Heavenly Pool, Regret Pool, and Wine Pool the three legendary pools of the world, all famous in history.",
      "chapters": [
        2077
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-legendary-pools",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
